# make_interval() regression assertions (#2162)

# 1. Zero-arg defaults
00:00:00

# 2. Named: secs => 120
00:02:00

# 3. Named: days + hours
1 day 02:00:00

# 4. Named: years + months
1 year 6 mons

# 5. Positional: 1h30m
01:30:00

# 6. Named: weeks => 2 (= 14 days)
14 days

# 7. Named: secs => 90 (1m30s)
00:01:30

# 8. Arithmetic: now() + interval
future_ok

# 9. Named: mins => 45
00:45:00

# 10. Mixed positional: 1y 2m 3w (= 1y 2m 21d)
1 year 2 mons 21 days
